NAME
       cal - display a calendar

SYNOPSIS
       cal [[MONTH] YEAR]

DESCRIPTION
       Prints a month, or a whole year when only a year is given. With
       no argument the current month is shown. Today and the current
       month header are highlighted.

OPTIONS
       --help   show a short help text

EXAMPLES
       cal
       cal 9 2026
       cal 2026

SEE ALSO
       date(1)
